        fidelis:purpose "European research infrastructure consortium for social science data. CESSDA does not itself operate a data repository but sets standards for, coordinates and provides access to the distributed holdings of its national Service Provider archives. The Trust and Standards page describes CESSDA's CoreTrustSeal requirements for all Service Providers. CESSDA Data Catalogue provides a single discovery point for 40,000+ datasets across 15 national archives." ;
